AWEN 0.1

PROJECT New Project
OUTPUT task-list filtering refinement
ROOT .

REPOSITORY
  MODE existing
  ROOT .

SOURCES
  CHANGE ./refinements/filter-requirements.md AUTHORITATIVE
  PRODUCT ./docs/requirements.md AUTHORITATIVE

BEHAVIOR
  visitors can show all, active or completed tasks
  changing the filter does not delete or alter tasks

REQUIRE
  preserve existing add, complete, remove and persistence behaviour

AVOID
  unrelated redesigns and new dependencies

EXECUTION
  1. Read the root project.awen and all authoritative sources.
  2. Inspect the existing task-list implementation and tests.
  3. Add the filter controls without changing stored task data.
  4. Test all three filters and regression-test existing behaviour.
  5. Report any conflicts with the root sheet before proceeding.

DONE WHEN
  1. All, Active and Completed views show the correct tasks.
  2. Existing task operations and persistence still work.
  3. Tests pass.
